  "_about": "Classic cluster, generated by tools/gen_classic.py (edit that and regenerate), after a photo of BMW's analog cluster at night (apps/7.jpeg): the speed dial on the left (0..160 mph, 0..260 km/h) and the rev dial on the right (0..7, the redline at 6.5), red-orange ticks and numbers, a tapered glowing needle and a hub in each, a small fuel dial far left and a small temperature dial far right, the lit display between them with the time, range and outside temperature, the gear letter and drive mode under the rev dial, and the speed digitally inside the speed dial. Black covers BMW's gauges. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
